  "title": "After the Concubine's Fake Death, the Heir Searches for Three Years",
  "author": "Gui Yan Jiu",
  "synopsis": "\nAt first, in Zhao Xuanyou's eyes, Yu Ying was just an ordinary concubine…beautiful, flattering, nothing more than a plaything.\n\nWatching Yu Ying scheme her way up, reveling in her petty triumphs, he treated it all as mere amusement.It wasn't until she faked her death and escaped that Zhao Xuanyou realized; he didn't just covet her beauty, but everything about her, including her cold, icy heart.\n\nHer birth mother was gravely ill, so she sold herself into the marquis' mansion.Sent to the heir's bed by the mistress, she fell into a plot to replace the mother with the child.\n\nAfter reincarnating, Yu Ying walked alone in the darkness. For revenge, she discarded her dignity and freedom.She never thought someone would walk beside her, hand in hand, all the way to the pinnacle of power.\n\nA pearl in the crown, admired by all.\n\n\n",
